<title>USA: Grand Union CFO Kenneth Baum resigns.</title>
<headline>Grand Union CFO Kenneth Baum resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grand Union Co said on Thursday that Chief Financial Officer Kenneth Baum has resigned.</p>
<p>Baum, who has resigned to pursue &quot;other career opportunities,&quot; plans to remain in the position through the end of the year, the company said.</p>
<p>A successor has not yet been named.</p>
